## Interface: 16001
## Title: Warlock Pet & Proc Management
## Notes: Warlock pet warnings: your demon is not attacking in a fight, it attacks an enemy without your Demonic Brand, or its health is low. Proc alert: Decimation (Soul Fire now). Custom text and sound.
